    </style><script type="application/ld+json" id="bv-jsonld-aggregate-rating-data">{"@context":"https://schema.org","aggregateRating":{"@type":"AggregateRating","bestRating":5,"ratingValue":"3.3","reviewCount":11},"@id":"https://www.next.co.uk/style/su691466/g00406"}</script><script type="application/ld+json" id="bv-jsonld-reviews-data">{"review":[{"dateCreated":"2026-05-15T14:23:33.000+00:00","datePublished":"2026-05-18T16:45:10.000+00:00","headline":"Disappointed","reviewBody":"First pair of Nikes EVER that I've regretted buying. They are saggy around the heel/ankle (and I'm not small-boned) and they hurt my toe when flex my toes while walking, just where the fabric compresses. I tried them indoors first and they seemed ok. Wish I'd sent them back. \n2 stars because OK for BodyPump.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":2,"bestRating":5},"author":{"@type":"Person","name":"catherine39912181"},"image":[],"video":[]},{"dateCreated":"2026-04-25T14:23:08.000+00:00","datePublished":"2026-04-27T15:30:17.000+00:00","headline":"Sizing way out!","reviewBody":"Ordered my usual size as well as one size up and a size down as sometimes I vary with sports shoes…but even the smallest size was ridiculously large! I’d have to order 2-2.5 sizes down from my usual to stand a chance of these fitting which is ridiculous.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":2,"bestRating":5},"author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Deanne520971444"},"image":[],"video":[]},{"dateCreated":"2026-02-16T07:01:08.000+00:00","datePublished":"2026-02-16T07:31:43.000+00:00","headline":"BEAUTIFUL COLOUR","reviewBody":"Beautiful colour.\nI haven't worn them yet but I'm hoping they will be just as comfortable as all the other Nike trainers I've purchased over the years.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5},"author":{"@type":"Person","name":"ophelia26"},"image":[],"video":[]},{"dateCreated":"2026-02-04T09:34:36.000+00:00","datePublished":"2026-02-04T11:31:36.000+00:00","headline":"Look great","reviewBody":"Very comfy","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5},"author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Lisa A"},"image":[],"video":[]},{"dateCreated":"2026-01-26T15:23:43.000+00:00","datePublished":"2026-01-26T15:45:14.000+00:00","headline":"Not the colour advertised","reviewBody":"Red trainers look nothing like the colour on the site.  Ordered because they appear red, instead they are pink.  Phoned Nike to complain and was told the colour is “sweet beets” as if that is an actual descriptive colour that you should reference instead of the numerous photos showing red shoes.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":2,"bestRating":5},"author":{"@type":"Person","name":"M643909883"},"image":[],"video":[]},{"dateCreated":"2026-01-24T15:23:35.000+00:00","datePublished":"2026-01-25T05:30:05.000+00:00","headline":"Designed with a thought","reviewBody":"I like the shoes. Their pad is flat, which is useful for plyometric exercises (they make impact on bones), flexible - my movements are not restricted.  My training types: indoor running, resistance training, plyometrics, mobility.","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":5,"bestRating":5},"author":{"@type":"Person","name":"lilijab205820281"},"image":[],"video":[]},{"dateCreated":"2026-01-22T15:23:57.000+00:00","datePublished":"2026-01-22T16:15:15.000+00:00","headline":"Colours do not match.","reviewBody":"The colours do not match the picture. I wish I'd have read the reviews. The pink is more a grey colour, not even a hint of blush pink. Disappointed","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":3,"bestRating":5},"author":{"@type":"Person","name":"JenniferB761255158"},"image":[],"video":[]},{"dateCreated":"2026-01-17T15:23:35.000+00:00","datePublished":"2026-01-17T15:45:27.000+00:00","headline":"Don't buy them pink ones","reviewBody":"The pink is absolutely not pink. Nothing like the picture. Very disappointed","reviewRating":{"@type":"Rating","ratingValue":2,"bestRating":5},"author":{"@type":"Person","name":"Hayleye9b7adb7f"},"image":[],"video":[]}],"@id":"https://www.next.co.uk/style/su691466/g00406","@context":"https://schema.org"}</script><style>.cm_bootstrap .lSSlideOuter .lSPager.lSpg > li.active:hover a { background-color: #548074; border: 1px solid #548074; } .cm_bootstrap .lSSlideOuter .lSPager.lSpg > li.active a { background-color: #548074; border: 1px solid #548074; } .cm_bootstrap .hp-btn-link-forwardslash { color: #548074; } .cm_bootstrap .hp-tile-module-labelmix-text-and-images__header { color: #548074; } </style></head><body class="mouse_active" style="padding-right: 15px; overflow: hidden;"><noscript id="host_buildid">1885029</noscript><script>
