fs></svg></abbr><span class="bv-rnr__bm6gry-0 cViGBA">2 out of 5 stars.</span></div><div class="bv-rnr__sc-16dr7i1-21 bLRaeH"><h3 aria-describedby="bv-review-249964938" class="bv-rnr__sc-16dr7i1-17 bBGUFb">Sizing way out!</h3><div class="bv-rnr__tbt1zd-0 gIIhxN"><div class="bv-rnr__tbt1zd-1 bSWXQl"><div class="bv-rnr__sc-16dr7i1-20 hEOEnK"></div><div class="bv-rnr__g3jej5-0 ccxgyA"><span class="bv-rnr__g3jej5-1 jolJQc">a month ago</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="bv-rnr__sc-16dr7i1-14 fKdXxQ"><div data-bv-v="contentSummary" class="bv-rnr__sc-16dr7i1-7 bwLWiZ"><div tabindex="-1" id="bv-review-text-249964938" class="bv-rnr__sc-16dr7i1-3 hTUFxW">Ordered my usual size as well as one size up and a size down as sometimes I vary with sports shoes…but even the smallest size was ridiculously large! I’d have to order 2-2.5 sizes down from my usual to stand a chance of these fitting which is ridiculous.</div><div class="bv-rnr__sc-16dr7i1-13 flweSz"></div><div class="bv-rnr__sc-1grr47e-0 cxGpQu"><div class="bv-rnr__sc-1grr47e-1 bhTbti"><img src="./women6_files/0d15984f-2a9e-483a-a644-5f44404db9a5" alt="" width="50" height="50"></div><div class="bv-rnr__sc-1grr47e-2 dDdHob"><p class="bv-rnr__sc-1grr47e-3 hCiaBm">Originally posted on Nike</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="bv-rnr__sc-16dr7i1-11 bDrXSA"></div></div></div></div></section><section id="bv-review-1213300610" aria-label="3 out of 8 reviews, ratings 5 out of 5."><div class="bv-rnr__sc-16dr7i1-1 jtRfje"><div data-bv-v="contentItem" itemscope="" class="bv-rnr__sc-16dr7i1-0 bv-rnr__sc-16dr7i1-23 jZQSED bfiwNO"><div data-bv-v="inlineProfile" class="bv-rnr__sc-16dr7i1-2 hGCEeE"><div class="bv-rnr__emkap-0 kuRIjh"><div role="presentation" class="bv-rnr__emkap-4 cTZbwb"><div role="presentation" class="bv-rnr__sc-1r4hv38-3 biYZeN"><button class="bv-rnr__sc-16j1lpy-5 bv-rnr__sc-1r4hv38-1 dOWFMv drBrAa bv-rnr-action-bar" aria-label="See ophelia26 profile. This action will open a modal dialog." tabi