 bBGUFb">Colours do not match.</h3><div class="bv-rnr__tbt1zd-0 gIIhxN"><div class="bv-rnr__tbt1zd-1 bSWXQl"><div class="bv-rnr__sc-16dr7i1-20 hEOEnK"></div><div class="bv-rnr__g3jej5-0 ccxgyA"><span class="bv-rnr__g3jej5-1 jolJQc">4 months ago</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class="bv-rnr__sc-16dr7i1-14 fKdXxQ"><div data-bv-v="contentSummary" class="bv-rnr__sc-16dr7i1-7 bwLWiZ"><div tabindex="-1" id="bv-review-text-247637743" class="bv-rnr__sc-16dr7i1-3 hTUFxW">The colours do not match the picture. I wish I'd have read the reviews. The pink is more a grey colour, not even a hint of blush pink. Disappointed</div><div class="bv-rnr__sc-16dr7i1-13 flweSz"></div><div class="bv-rnr__sc-1grr47e-0 cxGpQu"><div class="bv-rnr__sc-1grr47e-1 bhTbti"><img src="./women6_files/0d15984f-2a9e-483a-a644-5f44404db9a5" alt="" width="50" height="50"></div><div class="bv-rnr__sc-1grr47e-2 dDdHob"><p class="bv-rnr__sc-1grr47e-3 hCiaBm">Originally posted on Nike</p></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="bv-rnr__sc-16dr7i1-11 bDrXSA"></div></div></div></div></section><section id="bv-review-247521149" aria-label="8 out of 8 reviews, ratings 2 out of 5."><div class="bv-rnr__sc-16dr7i1-1 jtRfje"><div data-bv-v="contentItem" itemscope="" class="bv-rnr__sc-16dr7i1-0 bv-rnr__sc-16dr7i1-23 jZQSED bfiwNO"><div data-bv-v="inlineProfile" class="bv-rnr__sc-16dr7i1-2 hGCEeE"><div class="bv-rnr__emkap-0 kuRIjh"><div role="presentation" class="bv-rnr__emkap-4 eQcxjy"><div role="presentation" class="bv-rnr__sc-1r4hv38-3 biYZeN"><div itemscope="" class="bv-rnr__sc-1r4hv38-2 kPtqzh"><span disabled="" class="bv-rnr__sc-1r4hv38-0 dWWqxa">Hayleye9b7adb7f</span></div></div></div><div class="bv-rnr__sc-16dr7i1-20 dMoRVl"></div><div class="bv-rnr__emkap-5 hJYLFq"><div class="bv-rnr__emkap-1 dUNcFq"><span></span></div><div class="bv-rnr__emkap-2 qqvVa"><div class="bv-rnr__sc-1yppnmf-0 fJzmAF"><div class="bv-rnr__sc-1yppnmf-1 eWJSfB"><div class="bv-rnr__f9cpbf-0 fIWANC"><span class="bv-rnr__f9cp